{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":34730,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793440441900,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"episodeCount":13,"posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"791055","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuugo, a hostage negotiator from Japan, is enlisted by a young woman named Mayuko Iwase whose father has been taken hostage by a warlord in Pakistan.  The previous negotiator, hired by her father's employer, was killed when negotiations broke down due to military intervention.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-02-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hkkl7BcSPrPjojAbng3AnPTeLqd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hkkl7BcSPrPjojAbng3AnPTeLqd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34730/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"791056","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuugo continues preparations in Pakistan.  Before his departure, he was given a lead on a an Sheik who may be willing to assist him in making contact with the warlord holding Mayuko's father.  Following a chance encounter, Yuugo frees a young woman being kept as a slave by a band of travellers.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-03-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v38bsePCu8A5m2ywDt4FDGycpgL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v38bsePCu8A5m2ywDt4FDGycpgL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34730/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"791057","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuugo updates Mayuko on his progress by radio.  The military intercept the transmission and take an interest in the expedition.  Taking refuge in a cave from a searching helicopter, Yuugo and the young woman who is now following him are discovered by a Daku patrol.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-03-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uOkBdPXkeZuF5iJX33wEgPgkhhS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uOkBdPXkeZuF5iJX33wEgPgkhhS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34730/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"791058","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuugo has been sentenced to death by the Daku.  They tie him to a stone and leave him to his fate in the noon sun.  Knowing that Yusuf Ali is watching, Yuugo resolves to demonstrate to Ali that he is a warrior with whom he should negotiate.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-03-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/678Y3PnKCsPiNrGJ82EAoKC4MTW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/678Y3PnKCsPiNrGJ82EAoKC4MTW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34730/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"791059","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Having gained the trust of Yusuf Ali, Yuugo must now contact Mayuko once again to arrange the randsom funds.  Knowing that a further radio transmission will draw the military to the Daku camp, he persuades Ali that the camp must be evacuated.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-03-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k1CtGbM42kB2LpHpD9QkB9pQMiG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k1CtGbM42kB2LpHpD9QkB9pQMiG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"h